    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="c1_lead">A root, a track and its slides. Slides crossfade and loop, full-height arrows sit on each edge, the dots are generated, and a click anywhere on a slide moves it on. Swipe and the arrow keys work too. The height is set once, on the root.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10">

