      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70" data-sw-text="c4_lead"><code class="font-code text-base">data-autoscroll</code> turns the steps into a steady scroll, measured in pixels per frame. It pauses while hovered or focused. Pair it with the slide effect and leave looping on, so the ticker never reaches an end. Below: the projects and standards Sitewright is built on.</p>
