      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-8 px-14">
        <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold">Does it work without JavaScript?</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Yes. The track is a CSS scroll-snap row, so it still swipes and scrolls. Arrows and dots stay hidden, so no dead controls show.</p>
      </div>
    </figure>
